### Summary

Closes #517. Adds a `stage_for_baseplate` function that prepares `unstructured` output for ingestion into Baseplate through the Baseplate API. The [Baseplate docs](https://docs.baseplate.ai/api-reference/documents/overview) show how the data needs to be formatted.

### Testing

You can run the staging function with the following code

```python
  from unstructured.documents.elements import ElementMetadata, NarrativeText, Title
  from unstructured.staging.baseplate import stage_for_baseplate

  metadata = ElementMetadata(filename="fox.epub")

  elements = [
    Title("A Wonderful Story About A Fox", metadata=metadata),
    NarrativeText(
      "A fox ran into the chicken coop and the chickens flew off!",
      metadata=metadata,
    ),
  ]

  rows = stage_for_baseplate(elements)
```

